--- A. the label is the signal; the look-alike flags are not consulted
 ryman | tso 
-------+-----
 t     | f

--- B. the description alone is enough, and spelling variants are caught
 hyphen | spaced | resale_clause 
--------+--------+---------------
 t      | t      | t

--- C. an event that says nothing about it is left alone
 empty_body | ordinary | malformed 
------------+----------+-----------
 f          | f        | f

--- D. the settle retires one, and the fill will not take it back
 settle_calls_detector | settle_retires | fill_excludes 
-----------------------+----------------+---------------
 t                     | t              | t

--- E. the feeds exclude it entirely, and keep their own reloptions
 events_feed_excludes | listings_feed_excludes | dead_reason_left_behind | events_security_invoker | listings_reloptions 
----------------------+------------------------+-------------------------+-------------------------+---------------------
 t                    | t                      | f                       | t                       | NULL
